# ATV5000.  Generated from probe results; do not edit by hand.
# Rows are numbered per cell: I/O cell k has rows 20k..20k+19 (sum A 3
# regional + 1 universal, B 3 + 2, C 3 + 1, CK1 AR1 AP1 OE AR2 CK2 AP2),
# buried cell n rows 1040+8n.. (sum 4 + 1, CK AR AP).  Columns 0..319 are
# the four regional buses, 320..423 the I/O pins of the universal bus.
